---
version: 2.0.2
title: vulns help
file: ./test/licence_audit/output_snapshot_test.gleam
test_name: vulns_help_test
---
Report known vulnerabilities for locked dependencies using the OSV.dev database.
Does not evaluate licence policy. Includes dev dependencies unless --scope=prod
is set. Queries OSV directly and uses no on-disk cache.

Command: vulns

USAGE:
    licence_audit vulns [ --color=<auto|always|never> --config=<PATH>
        --format=<text|json> --ignore-config --manifest=<PATH> --quiet
        --scope=<prod|all> --verbose ]

FLAGS:
    --color=<auto|always|never>  Colorize output: auto|always|never (default
                                 auto; alias: --colour)

    --config=<PATH>              Read configuration from PATH

    --format=<text|json>         Output format: text|json (default text)

    --help                       Print help information

    --ignore-config              Ignore configuration files

    --manifest=<PATH>            Read manifest from PATH

    --quiet                      Suppress progress output (alias: -q)

    --scope=<prod|all>           Dependency scope: prod|all (production only or
                                 all dependencies)

    --verbose                    Show detailed progress output (alias: -v)

